Evolution relation:
```lean
/-- Continuous-time evolution relation: componentwise `λ_i' = F_i(λ)` on `[0,T]`. -/
structure EvolutionRelation (F : ReactionField ι) (T : ℝ) (traj : ℝ → ι → ℝ) : Prop where
  continuous : ∀ i, ContinuousOn (fun t => traj t i) (Icc 0 T)
  hasDeriv : ∀ i, ∀ t ∈ Ico 0 T, HasDerivWithinAt (fun s => traj s i) (F.eval (traj t) i) (Ici t) t

/-- Explicit Euler evolution relation. -/
structure DiscreteEvolution (F : ReactionField ι) (h : ℝ) (traj : ℕ → ι → ℝ) : Prop where
  step : ∀ n i, traj (n+1) i = traj n i + h * F.eval (traj n) i
```

Also `eulerStep`:
```lean
noncomputable def eulerStep (F : ReactionField ι) (h : ℝ) (λ : ι → ℝ) : ι → ℝ :=
  fun i => λ i + h * F.eval λ i
```
